   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Albino Sunburn Girl**: rare: 13 archived performances [4]\n- **Hey, Bulldog**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2006-07-21.schoeps.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 35 songs; 172 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **Ween2006-07-21**: source not stated; 35 songs; 173 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The Independent was a tiny, intimate room, and the recording captures that closeness [3]\n- Reviewer felt Ween were at a peak in their performances around this weekend [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2006-07-21.schoeps.flac16**: source: Schoeps MK4's > Ruetelhuber Preamp > Sony M1 > DAT Master (48kHz/16 bit) [1]. Also: Mastered from WAV on a MacBook Pro in ProTools 8.0.5 with EQ, compression and limiter, then output as 48kHz/16-bit FLAC [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by scrapedknee.com: [Ween – San Francisco, CA – 2006 : Scraped Knee](https://scrapedknee.com/ween-san-francisco-ca-2006/) [5]",
